				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1036{\fonttbl{\f0\fmodern\fprq6\fcharset0 Tahoma;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs16 The State Chart element in Rhapsody automatically contains a state chart diagram named  &quot;statechart + diagram&quot; when created,the Diagram suffix was removed to avoid the &quot;DiagramDiagram&quot; display in the diagram name.\par%0D
However the diagram toolbar is associated to the OperatingModeChart stereotype\par%0D
Note: can't add states or operating modes from the browser\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
			</m_pNoteText>
